## Mayfly defaults for AWS Lambda. Copy this file into your own
## rel/ directory and set `rel_templates_path` to customise.

## No busy waiting: Lambda bills for wall time, spinning schedulers only burn CPU.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## No shell in Lambda.
-noinput

## Scheduler count: the generated bootstrap appends "+S 1:1" via
## ELIXIR_ERL_OPTIONS on standard Lambda (one vCPU below ~1.8 GB, one
## invocation at a time). On Lambda Managed Instances the environment has
## several vCPUs and runs AWS_LAMBDA_MAX_CONCURRENCY invocations in parallel,
## so the VM's default (one scheduler per online CPU) is used there.
+SDio 2
